## 📌 Executive Overview

Modern tech recruitment has become an adversarial game: job boards obfuscate direct contact emails, saturated ATS portals screen out qualified candidates using brittle filters, and Cloudflare Turnstile blocks automated search discovery.

**Pasha Hunt 3.0** completely reverses this dynamic by giving candidates an autonomous, local-first career command center:
1. **Multi-Source Sourcing:** Crawls 16+ tech portals concurrently and executes AI-grounded searches across global remote and regional ecosystems.
2. **Stealth Anti-Bot Harvesting:** Employs **D4Vinci Scrapling (v0.5.1)** with headless Chrome fingerprint spoofing to bypass Cloudflare Turnstile, extract unlisted recruiter emails, and parse job structures.
3. **Fact-Grounded ATS Tailoring:** Eliminates AI hallucinations by cross-verifying every resume bullet point against verified candidate profile facts before rendering pixel-perfect 2-page master PDFs.
4. **Direct Outreach Automation:** Automatically prepares complete Gmail draft packages—tailored cover letter, ATS resume PDF, and customized subject line—for one-click candidate review.
5. **Dual User Experience:** Runs both as a high-performance native Windows 11 luxury dark desktop app (Tkinter/Canvas) and as an interactive web workstation (`desktop_server.py` + `desktop_ui/`).

