## ⚙ Configuration Guide

Pasha Hunt is configured via `config.json` or the in-app settings panel:

```json
{
  "gmail_address": "your.email@gmail.com",
  "gmail_app_password": "xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx",
  "imap_host": "imap.gmail.com",
  "gemini_api_key": "YOUR_GEMINI_OR_APINEX_API_KEY",
  "gemini_model": "gemini-2.5-flash",
  "work_modes": ["remote", "hybrid", "onsite"],
  "keywords": [
    "Full Stack Developer",
    "Software Engineer",
    "Python Developer",
    "FastAPI",
    "React Developer",
    "AI Agent Developer"
  ],
  "exclude_keywords": ["PHP", "WordPress", "Magento"],
  "keywords_in_title": true,
  "max_job_age_days": 30,
  "max_years_required": 4,
  "my_region_words": ["lahore", "pakistan", "worldwide"],
  "search_google": true
}
```

> **Gmail Security Note:** Standard passwords are not accepted by Google IMAP. Create a 16-character **App Password** via: `Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → App Passwords`.

