## 🔒 Privacy & Security First

Pasha Hunt is architected under strict **Local-First Data Sovereignty** principles:
* **Zero Telemetry:** No user analytics, activity trackers, or third-party cookies.
* **Local Credentials:** Your Gmail App Password and Gemini API keys never leave your local drive.
* **Human-in-the-Loop Guarantee:** Pasha Hunt never sends emails autonomously; all outbound messages are staged into Gmail Drafts for manual review.
* For comprehensive terms, read our official [PRIVACY.md](PRIVACY.md).

